  "setup": "start.sh extracts files from the image, patches them on the host and bind-mounts them read-only over vllm (ple_layer.py, modelopt, QSA ops/nvidia, mtp.py, flashinfer_cutlass_moe.py, PLE offload worker/connector/protocol, block-drop backport of vllm#53388); first boot builds a ~27 GB packed PLE table in a throwaway container into ~/.cache/vllm/ple_cache (mounted at /root/.cache/vllm); host memwatch watchdog + optional systemd supervisor; draft vocab file mounted at /root/draft_vocab.txt.",
